    <div class="intro-content the-economy">
        <p class="icon-type-label icon-type-news-release">News Release</p>

        <h1 itemprop="name">Philadelphia Fed&rsquo;s Harker: On Inflation, &ldquo;Let&rsquo;s Stick to the Game Plan&rdquo;</h1>


        <p class="article-date-published" itemprop="datePublished">27 Feb ’25</p>

        <p class="intro-excerpt" itemprop="description">In his remarks at the Feb. 27 Lyons Economic Outlook conference at the University of Delaware, President Patrick Harker shared the policy rate remains restrictive enough to continue putting downward pressure on inflation over the longer term while not negatively impacting the rest of the economy.</p>

        <div class="article-intro-footer">

            <div>


            </div>



        </div>


    </div>

</div>

